  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1146",
    "issue_date": "2026-05-28T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-28T11:56:45.668Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा पश्चिमी वायू र स्थानीय वायू तथा नेपालको पूर्वी भू-भाग नजिक रहेको न्यून चापीय क्षेत्रको प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, Nepal is under the influence of Westerly winds and local winds, along with a low-pressure area located near the eastern region of Nepal.",
    "today_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ। बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेश लगायत कोशी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानहरूमा, तथा मधेश प्रदेश लगायत कोशी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ। लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका तराई र पहाडी भू–भाग तथा बाँकी तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा हावाहुरीको पनि सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely throughout the country. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder/lightning at a few places of the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Koshi Province including Bagmati Province, Gandaki Province, Lumbini Province, Karnali Province, and Sudurpashchim Province, and at one or two places of the Terai region of Koshi Province including Madhesh Province. There is also a possibility of gusty winds at a few places of the Terai and Hilly regions of Lumbini Province as well as the remaining Terai region.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ। गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेश लगायत बाँकी हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानहरूमा तथा मधेश प्रदेश लगायत कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशका तराई भूभागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ । सुदूरपश्चिम, कर्णाली र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका तराई र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा हावाहुरीको पनि सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely throughout the country. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder/lightning at a few places of Gandaki Province, Lumbini Province, Karnali Province, and Sudurpashchim Province including the remaining Himalayan and Hilly regions, and at one or two places of the Terai region of Koshi Province and Bagmati Province including Madhesh Province. There is also a possibility of gusty winds at a few places of the Terai and Hilly regions of Sudurpashchim, Karnali, and Lumbini Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
